  },
  "question": {
    "text": "A body of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> moving with a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;makes an elastic collision with another body at rest and continues to move in the original direction but with one fourth of its initial speed. The speed of the two body centre of mass is $x/10$. Find the value of x."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>By coefficient of restitution,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>cm</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>cm</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p>"
  }
